{"id":"000W0N","title":"Hot Property","author":"ChinStrap","solvedCount":1,"difficulty":3,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-11-12T12:51:14+00:00","posted":"Heute, 13:16 Uhr","rules":"Dorlir set a challenge to make more chaos constructions using 4 9 cell regions. Thanks to all testers and I hope you enjoy!\n\nPlay Now! →\n\nRules\n\nRegions• Divide the grid into four regions of 9 orthogonally connected cells. Each region contains the digits 1–9 once each. Digits don't repeat in any row or column.\n\nSlow thermometer• Values along the green line never decrease as you move away from the bulb.\n\nOutside clues• Each white outside cell must contain a digit, which is both a skyscraper clue and a region counter.\n\nSkyscrapers• A digit in an outside clue counts how many digits are 'seen' looking into the grid in the row/column. Digits are visible when they are larger than all digits before them.\n\nRegion counters• Digits in outside clues also count the total number of different regions in their row/column.","solutionCode":"Row 4, left to right, with a dash at each region border","tags":["Sudoku","Hochhäuser","Thermo (Variante)","Chaos Construction (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/jqiy8apxnu?setting-nogrid=true","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"settings":{"nogrid":"true"},"link":"https://sudokupad.app/jqiy8apxnu?setting-nogrid=true","linkKind":"sudokupad","summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":8,"cols":8,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines"]},"attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-11-12T12:51:14+00:00"}